i>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"REL\"><mo>:=</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"REL\"><mo>:=</mo></mrow><munderover><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∑</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>k</mi></mrow></munderover><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> The set <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"R[x]\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D445 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> with this\naddition and this multiplication is the <strong>polynomial ring</strong>\nover <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"R\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D445 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</p>","file":"ch04-formal-polynomials/02-polynomial-ring.html"}